# Frontend Development Rules

## Project Structure
```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── common/
│   │   ├── Button.tsx
│   │   ├── Input.tsx
│   │   ├── Modal.tsx
│   │   ├── Table.tsx
│   │   └── Form.tsx
│   ├── layout/
│   │   ├── Header.tsx
│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx
│   │   └── Footer.tsx
│   ├── properties/
│   │   ├── PropertyList.tsx
│   │   ├── PropertyDetails.tsx
│   │   └── PropertyForm.tsx
│   ├── tenants/
│   │   ├── TenantList.tsx
│   │   ├── TenantDetails.tsx
│   │   └── TenantForm.tsx
│   ├── evictions/
│   │   ├── EvictionList.tsx
│   │   ├── EvictionDetails.tsx
│   │   ├── EvictionForm.tsx
│   │   └── EvictionTimeline.tsx
│   └── reports/
│       ├── EvictionReport.tsx
│       ├── PaymentReport.tsx
│       └── OccupancyReport.tsx
├── pages/
│   ├── Dashboard.tsx
│   ├── Properties.tsx
│   ├── Tenants.tsx
│   ├── Evictions.tsx
│   └── Reports.tsx
├── hooks/
│   ├── useAuth.ts
│   ├── useProperties.ts
│   ├── useTenants.ts
│   └── useEvictions.ts
├── services/
│   ├── api.ts
│   ├── auth.ts
│   └── storage.ts
├── utils/
│   ├── dates.ts
│   ├── currency.ts
│   └── validation.ts
└── styles/
    ├── global.css
    └── theme.ts
```

## Component Guidelines

### Common Components
- Use TypeScript for all components
- Implement responsive design
- Follow accessibility standards
- Include proper error handling
- Add loading states
- Use proper prop types

### Forms
- Implement form validation
- Show validation errors
- Include success messages
- Handle API errors
- Add loading states
- Use controlled components

### Tables
- Implement sorting
- Add filtering
- Include pagination
- Show loading states
- Handle empty states
- Allow bulk actions

## State Management
- Use React Query for server state
- Implement proper caching
- Handle loading states
- Manage error states
- Update optimistically
- Sync with backend

## Styling
- Use Tailwind CSS
- Follow design system
- Maintain consistency
- Support dark mode
- Handle responsiveness
- Use CSS modules

## Authentication
- Implement JWT auth
- Handle token refresh
- Manage user sessions
- Add role-based access
- Secure routes
- Handle expired tokens

## Performance
- Implement code splitting
- Use lazy loading
- Optimize images
- Cache API responses
- Minimize bundle size
- Monitor performance

## Error Handling
- Show error messages
- Log errors
- Retry failed requests
- Handle offline state
- Provide fallbacks
- Monitor errors

## Testing
- Write unit tests
- Add integration tests
- Test components
- Mock API calls
- Test error states
- Maintain coverage

## Documentation
- Document components
- Add code comments
- Update README
- Include examples
- Document APIs
- Keep docs current

## Development
- Use ESLint
- Implement Prettier
- Follow Git flow
- Review code
- Use TypeScript
- Monitor quality

## Deployment
- Build optimization
- Environment config
- CI/CD pipeline
- Version control
- Monitoring
- Analytics

## Features

### Dashboard
- Show key metrics
- Display charts
- List recent activity
- Show alerts
- Quick actions
- Status overview

### Property Management
- List properties
- Property details
- Add/edit properties
- Upload photos
- Manage units
- Track occupancy

### Tenant Management
- List tenants
- Tenant profiles
- Add/edit tenants
- Document upload
- Payment history
- Communication log

### Eviction Management
- List evictions
- Eviction details
- File evictions
- Track timeline
- Generate docs
- Court dates

### Reporting
- Generate reports
- Export data
- Custom filters
- Save templates
- Schedule reports
- Share reports

## UI/UX Guidelines

### Colors
```css
:root {
  --primary: #2563eb;
  --secondary: #475569;
  --success: #22c55e;
  --danger: #ef4444;
  --warning: #f59e0b;
  --info: #3b82f6;
  --light: #f8fafc;
  --dark: #1e293b;
}
```

### Typography
```css
:root {
  --font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui;
  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  --font-size-base: 16px;
  --line-height-base: 1.5;
}
```

### Spacing
```css
:root {
  --spacing-xs: 0.25rem;
  --spacing-sm: 0.5rem;
  --spacing-md: 1rem;
  --spacing-lg: 1.5rem;
  --spacing-xl: 2rem;
}
```

### Breakpoints
```css
:root {
  --breakpoint-sm: 640px;
  --breakpoint-md: 768px;
  --breakpoint-lg: 1024px;
  --breakpoint-xl: 1280px;
}
```

### Shadows
```css
:root {
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}
```

### Animations
```css
:root {
  --transition-base: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
  --transition-slow: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
  --transition-fast: all 0.1s ease-in-out;
}
```

